  description: '"Dark Magician" + 1 Level 7 or higher monster

    Must be Fusion
    Summoned. Gains 500 ATK for every other monster on the field. Can attack all
    your opponent''s monsters, once each. Once per turn, when your opponent activates
    a Spell Card or effect (Quick Effect): You can negate that effect, then you can
    destroy 1 card on the field. After this card destroys a card by battle or card
    effect and sends it to the GY, neither player can activate its effects while
    it is in the GY.'
